---
args: { changes: ReleaseBehaviorDelta[], release: CompatibilityReleaseRequest }
returns: BehaviorConsumerMap[]
---
For each behavior delta match consumers by the specific contract they rely on. Bind the integration owner, customer pin, example, or runbook evidence. Keep uncertain consumers in targeted replay scope. If an integration has no accountable owner, mark it unowned and prohibit advancing its risky migration wave.
